{"entries":[{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"炸板长上影","family":"astock","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["close","close_pos","high","limit","upper_wick","vol_ratio"],"pattern_id":"pv.astock.failed_limit_long_upper","predicate":"盘中触及涨停(high 达涨停价附近)但收盘回落未封(limit≠涨停),留下长上影(upper_wick ≥ min_upper_wick_frac)、收于中下部(close_pos ≤ max_close_pos),常伴放量(vol_ratio ≥ min_vol_ratio):冲高回落、多头受阻(炸板)。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"max_close_pos":0.5,"min_upper_wick_frac":0.4,"min_vol_ratio":1.5},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"涨停突破","family":"astock","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["body","breakout","close","limit","vol_ratio"],"pattern_id":"pv.astock.limit_up_breakout","predicate":"以涨停(limit=涨停)放量(vol_ratio ≥ min_vol_ratio)突破前期高点(breakout=突破前高),且非一字(有实体换手 body ≥ min_body_frac):强势突破启动。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"min_body_frac":0.02,"min_vol_ratio":1.5},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"一字板","family":"astock","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["close","high","limit","low","open"],"pattern_id":"pv.astock.one_word_board","predicate":"开=高=低=收 全等(振幅 ≤ max_range_frac)且封于涨停(limit=涨停):全天一字封死,买不进(跌停一字则卖不出),T+1 流动性极端。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"max_range_frac":0.001},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"T字板","family":"astock","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["close","high","limit","low","lower_wick","open"],"pattern_id":"pv.astock.t_word_board","predicate":"收=高=开且封于涨停(收≈涨停价),盘中曾被砸开留下可见下影(lower_wick ≥ min_lower_wick_frac),形如字母 T:涨停开板又封回,资金分歧。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"close_eq_high_tol":0.001,"min_lower_wick_frac":0.05},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"阴包阳吞没","family":"double_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["body","close","open","prior_trend"],"pattern_id":"pv.double.bearish_engulfing","predicate":"前一根为阳、当根为阴,当根实体完全吞没前根实体(当根 open ≥ 前 close 且 当根 close ≤ 前 open),当根实体较大,出现在上涨之后(prior_trend=上涨):顶部反转。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"curr_body_min_frac":0.5,"engulf_cover_min":1.0,"prev_body_min_frac":0.1},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"阳包阴吞没","family":"double_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["body","close","open","prior_trend"],"pattern_id":"pv.double.bullish_engulfing","predicate":"前一根为阴、当根为阳,当根实体完全吞没前根实体(当根 open ≤ 前 close 且 当根 close ≥ 前 open),当根实体较大(body ≥ curr_body_min_frac),出现在下跌之后(prior_trend=下跌):底部反转做多。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"curr_body_min_frac":0.5,"engulf_cover_min":1.0,"prev_body_min_frac":0.1},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"乌云盖顶","family":"double_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["close","high","open","prev_close","prior_trend"],"pattern_id":"pv.double.dark_cloud_cover","predicate":"上涨中,前根大阳;当根高开(open ≥ 前 close)后收阴,收盘深入前根阳线实体过半(penetration ≥ penetration_min,但未完全吞没):顶部反转。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"penetration_min":0.5,"prev_body_min_frac":0.5},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"孕线","family":"double_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["body","close","open"],"pattern_id":"pv.double.harami","predicate":"前根大实体(body ≥ prev_body_min_frac),当根小实体(body ≤ curr_body_max_frac)且实体完全落在前根实体范围内(containment ≥ 1.0):趋势动能衰减、变盘。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"containment":1.0,"curr_body_max_frac":0.3,"prev_body_min_frac":0.5},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"曙光初现","family":"double_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["close","low","open","prev_close","prior_trend"],"pattern_id":"pv.double.piercing_line","predicate":"下跌中,前根大阴;当根低开(open ≤ 前 close)后收阳,收盘上穿前根阴线实体过半(penetration ≥ penetration_min,但未完全吞没):底部反转做多。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"penetration_min":0.5,"prev_body_min_frac":0.5},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"突破缺口","family":"gap","gap_fill_stats":{"fill_rate":null,"median_bars_to_fill":null,"n_gaps":null,"schema_version":"1"},"geometry_inputs":["breakout","high","low","prev_close","vol_ratio"],"pattern_id":"pv.gap.breakaway","predicate":"在盘整末端向趋势方向跳空(幅度 ≥ min_gap_frac),伴随明显放量(vol_ratio ≥ min_vol_ratio),且突破前期区间边界(breakout=突破前高/跌破前低):行情启动信号,通常不易快速回补。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"min_gap_frac":0.01,"min_vol_ratio":2.0},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"普通缺口","family":"gap","gap_fill_stats":{"fill_rate":null,"median_bars_to_fill":null,"n_gaps":null,"schema_version":"1"},"geometry_inputs":["breakout","high","low","prev_close","vol_ratio"],"pattern_id":"pv.gap.common","predicate":"相邻两根出现跳空(今 low > 昨 high 或 今 high < 昨 low),幅度小(≥ min_gap_frac)、发生在震荡区间内(breakout=区间内)、量能不放大(vol_ratio ≤ max_vol_ratio):无趋势意义,通常很快回补。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"max_vol_ratio":1.5,"min_gap_frac":0.005},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"衰竭缺口","family":"gap","gap_fill_stats":{"fill_rate":null,"median_bars_to_fill":null,"n_gaps":null,"schema_version":"1"},"geometry_inputs":["close_pos","high","low","prev_close","prior_trend","vol_ratio"],"pattern_id":"pv.gap.exhaustion","predicate":"趋势末端的最后一跳(幅度 ≥ min_gap_frac),常伴极端放量(vol_ratio ≥ min_vol_ratio)后迅速反向(次日反向确认、收盘位掉头):趋势枯竭,高回补概率。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"min_gap_frac":0.01,"min_vol_ratio":3.0},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"持续缺口(量度缺口)","family":"gap","gap_fill_stats":{"fill_rate":null,"median_bars_to_fill":null,"n_gaps":null,"schema_version":"1"},"geometry_inputs":["high","low","prev_close","prior_trend","vol_ratio"],"pattern_id":"pv.gap.runaway","predicate":"已确立的趋势途中再度同向跳空(prior_trend 同向,幅度 ≥ min_gap_frac),量能温和(vol_ratio ≤ vol_ratio_max),常位于整段行情中部,可作量度目标估算剩余空间:趋势健康的确认。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"min_gap_frac":0.01,"vol_ratio_max":3.0},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":true,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"箱体平台","family":"multi_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["close","range_atr","swing_high","swing_low"],"pattern_id":"pv.multi.box_range","predicate":"价格在水平上、下沿之间反复(上沿各高点离散 ≤ boundary_tol、下沿各低点离散 ≤ boundary_tol),至少 min_touch_points 次触边、箱高 ≤ max_box_height:窄幅震荡,区间高抛低吸参照,输出置信分。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"boundary_tol":0.03,"max_box_height":0.15,"min_lookback_bars":15.0,"min_touch_points":4.0},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":true,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"杯柄","family":"multi_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["close","prior_trend","swing_high","swing_low","vol_ratio"],"pattern_id":"pv.multi.cup_with_handle","predicate":"先一个圆弧底(U 形杯,缓跌缓涨,深度 cup_depth_min ≤ 回撤 ≤ cup_depth_max),右沿附近浅幅整理成柄(回撤 ≤ handle_retrace_max、持续 ≤ handle_max_bars 根、量缩);突破杯口确认。做多突破中继,输出置信分。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"cup_depth_max":0.35,"cup_depth_min":0.12,"handle_max_bars":15.0,"handle_retrace_max":0.5,"min_lookback_bars":30.0},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":true,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"双底(W底)","family":"multi_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["close","prior_trend","swing_high","swing_low"],"pattern_id":"pv.multi.double_bottom","predicate":"下跌后两个相近低点(高度差 ≤ bottom_symmetry_tol),中间夹一反弹峰(高度 ≥ peak_height_min);向上突破颈线确认。W 形底部反转,输出置信分。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"bottom_symmetry_tol":0.02,"min_lookback_bars":20.0,"peak_height_min":0.03},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":true,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"双顶(M头)","family":"multi_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["close","prior_trend","swing_high","swing_low"],"pattern_id":"pv.multi.double_top","predicate":"上涨后两个相近高点(高度差 ≤ peak_symmetry_tol),中间夹一回调谷(深度 ≥ valley_depth_min);跌破颈线(谷)确认。M 形顶部反转,输出置信分。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"min_lookback_bars":20.0,"peak_symmetry_tol":0.02,"valley_depth_min":0.03},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":true,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"旗形","family":"multi_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["close","prior_trend","range_atr","vol_ratio"],"pattern_id":"pv.multi.flag","predicate":"一段急涨/急跌旗杆(单向幅度 ≥ pole_move_min)后,小幅逆向的平行通道回调(旗面,回撤 ≤ flag_retrace_max、持续 ≤ max_flag_bars 根、量缩 vol_ratio ≤ vol_contract_max):顺势中继形态,输出置信分。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"flag_retrace_max":0.5,"max_flag_bars":10.0,"pole_move_min":0.15,"vol_contract_max":0.8},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":true,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"头肩底","family":"multi_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["close","prior_trend","swing_high","swing_low"],"pattern_id":"pv.multi.head_shoulders_bottom","predicate":"下跌后出现三个波谷:中谷(头)显著低于两侧谷,两肩高度相近;向上突破颈线确认:底部反转。宽松几何近似,输出置信分。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"head_prominence_min":0.02,"min_lookback_bars":20.0,"shoulder_symmetry_tol":0.03},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":true,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"头肩顶","family":"multi_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["close","prior_trend","swing_high","swing_low"],"pattern_id":"pv.multi.head_shoulders_top","predicate":"上涨后出现三个波峰:中峰(头)显著高于两侧峰(head 高出肩 ≥ head_prominence_min),两肩高度相近(差 ≤ shoulder_symmetry_tol);跌破颈线(两谷连线)确认。宽松几何近似,输出置信分。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"head_prominence_min":0.02,"min_lookback_bars":20.0,"shoulder_symmetry_tol":0.03},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":true,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"三角形整理","family":"multi_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["range_atr","swing_high","swing_low","vol_ratio"],"pattern_id":"pv.multi.triangle","predicate":"高点连线与低点连线相互收敛(后段振幅相对前段收敛 ≥ convergence_min),至少 min_touch_points 次触边、量能萎缩(vol_ratio 下行):对称/上升/下降三角整理,突破方向待定,输出置信分。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"convergence_min":0.5,"min_lookback_bars":15.0,"min_touch_points":4.0},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"十字星","family":"single_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["body","lower_wick","upper_wick"],"pattern_id":"pv.single.doji","predicate":"实体极小(body ≤ max_body_frac,收开近乎相等)、上下影均不极端(单侧影 ≤ max_shadow_frac,以区别长腿十字):多空僵持、变盘警示。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"max_body_frac":0.05,"max_shadow_frac":0.6},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"锤子线","family":"single_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["body","close_pos","lower_wick","prior_trend","upper_wick"],"pattern_id":"pv.single.hammer","predicate":"下影线长(下影/实体 ≥ lower_wick_to_body_min)、实体小(body ≤ max_body_frac)、上影极短(upper_wick ≤ max_upper_wick_frac)、收盘居上部(close_pos ≥ min_close_pos),且出现在一段下跌之后(prior_trend=下跌):见底做多信号。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"lower_wick_to_body_min":2.0,"max_body_frac":0.33,"max_upper_wick_frac":0.1,"min_close_pos":0.6},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"上吊线","family":"single_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["body","close_pos","lower_wick","prior_trend","upper_wick"],"pattern_id":"pv.single.hanging_man","predicate":"几何同锤子线(长下影、小实体、极短上影、收于上部),但出现在一段上涨之后(prior_trend=上涨):见顶警示,需次日阴线确认。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"lower_wick_to_body_min":2.0,"max_body_frac":0.33,"max_upper_wick_frac":0.1,"min_close_pos":0.6},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"长腿十字","family":"single_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["body","lower_wick","range_atr","upper_wick"],"pattern_id":"pv.single.long_legged_doji","predicate":"实体极小(body ≤ max_body_frac),上、下影均很长(各 ≥ min_leg_frac)、当根振幅大(range_atr ≥ min_range_atr):剧烈拉锯、分歧极大。","replay_stats":null,"rule_params":{"max_body_frac":0.05,"min_leg_frac":0.35,"min_range_atr":1.2},"schema_version":"1"},{"approximate":false,"definition_version":"1","display_name":"流星线","family":"single_bar","gap_fill_stats":null,"geometry_inputs":["body","close_pos","lower_wick","prior_trend","upper_wick"],"pattern_id":"pv.single.shoot